    - rid: 3152893607033695256
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0be64a9950f7b74e8fc6a7b3c511307, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: Do you really think people care about every small repair?
    - rid: 6440294235948890204
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 79f9981bdaa752d4fb771968622c6775, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: They are not following pieces of wood, stone, or paint.
    - rid: 5086448538733380049
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0be64a9950f7b74e8fc6a7b3c511307, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: What are they following?
    - rid: 8961372947576608060
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 79f9981bdaa752d4fb771968622c6775, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: You refusing to give up.
    - rid: 6706739925987178066
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ad4a74f0f2261874b962f568ba22424d, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: And Evelyns coffee recipes.
    - rid: 1735712959865492543
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 79f9981bdaa752d4fb771968622c6775, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: Mostly Maya refusing to give up while serving Evelyns coffee recipes.
    - rid: 783503763225717436
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0be64a9950f7b74e8fc6a7b3c511307, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: That is a very specific category.
    - rid: 6779659939877411458
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 79f9981bdaa752d4fb771968622c6775, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: It is performing extremely well.
    - rid: 3765790047963810951
      type: {class: ThoughtStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0be64a9950f7b74e8fc6a7b3c511307, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: Maybe this place can become more than a personal project.
